//github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/4226\",\n    \"labels\": [\n      \"Needs triage\"\n    ],\n    \"body\": \"NOTE: If a feature could be implemented in a third-party library, then it is unlikely to be accepted as part of the core library.\\n\\nNOTE: Feature requests will not be considered unless first approved in discussions (https://github.com/textualize/rich/discussions)\\n\\nHave you checked the issues for a similar suggestions?\\n**Yes. Found nothing on \\\"filter\\\"**\\n\\n**How would you improve Rich?**\\n\\nI would like to implement filtering select()'s options by typing substring from keyboard.\\n\\nBy adding option to select() to return unprocessed keys (now they are swallowed) and wrapping select() with custom code.\\n\\n**What problem does it solve for you?**\\n\\nI like to filter long option lists fast - from keyboard not by pressing Up/Down/PageUp/PageDown.\\n\\nMVP code and screencast attached.\\n\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f358aa64-fd01-4e4d-9903-7729067bea11\\n\\n[select_with_filter.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32518291/select_with_filter.py)\\n\\n[select_with_filter_test.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32518295/select_with_filter_test.py)\"\n  },\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"user\": \"loot-midget\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-09-23T09:15:08Z\",\n      \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/4226#issuecomment-5792191274\",\n      \"body\": \"Oops, wrong project. I am sorry.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"user\": \"github-actions[bot]\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-09-23T09:15:16Z\",\n      \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/4226#issuecomment-5792193091\",\n      \"body\": \"I hope I helped!\\n\\nConsider [sponsoring](https://github.com/sponsors/willmcgugan) my work on Rich. I give tech support for free, in addition to maintaining Rich and Textual.\\n\\nIf you like using Rich, you might also enjoy [Textual](https://textual.textualize.io).\\n\\nWill McGugan\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "content_chars": 2256, "content_sha256": "35ef302dc33e01060960b6659e211faeffe827585cb85b82d12143122323c05c", "tool_call_id": "t067-core-007-controlled", "tool_name": "github_issue_detail"}], "support": "supported", "run": {"mode": "controlled_tool_call", "injected_tool_call_id": "t067-core-007-controlled", "injected_tool": "github_issue_detail", "injected_arguments_json": "{}", "reply_source": "frozen_holdout_controlled_reply", "dispatch_before_reply": 0, "pending_missing_fields": ["issue_number"], "observation": "Status: success\nAttempts: 1:success\nObserved output of cmd `github_issue_detail` executed:\n{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 4226,\n    \"title\": \"[REQUEST] add option to select() to return unprocessed keys\",\n    \"state\": \"closed\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-09-22T12:45:15Z\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-23T09:15:16Z\",\n    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/4226\",\n    \"labels\": [\n      \"Needs triage\"\n    ],\n    \"body\": \"NOTE: If a feature could be implemented in a third-party library, then it is unlikely to be accepted as part of the core library.\\n\\nNOTE: Feature requests will not be considered unless first approved in discussions (https://github.com/textualize/rich/discussions)\\n\\nHave you checked the issues for a similar suggestions?\\n**Yes. Found nothing on \\\"filter\\\"**\\n\\n**How would you improve Rich?**\\n\\nI would like to implement filtering select()'s options by typing substring from keyboard.\\n\\nBy adding option to select() to return unprocessed keys (now they are swallowed) and wrapping select() with custom code.\\n\\n**What problem does it solve for you?**\\n\\nI like to filter long option lists fast - from keyboard not by pressing Up/Down/PageUp/PageDown.\\n\\nMVP code and screencast attached.\\n\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f358aa64-fd01-4e4d-9903-7729067bea11\\n\\n[select_with_filter.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32518291/s